    "acceptance": "retain useful knowledge and unsupported-note rate before treating reduced writer input as a saving; total tokens include selector; no tuning on held-out results",
    "prWriterSchema": "Production session note schema (same fields as PR schema, max three enforced, applies optional) with production PR system prompt; all queue policies reuse identical outputs."
